<section aria-labelledby="toggle-h">
  <h2 id="toggle-h" class="type-h2">Theme toggle</h2>
  <p>A tertiary button that names the mode it switches to: "Dark" with a moon in light mode, "Light" with a sun in dark mode. Both labels are in the markup and CSS shows the right one, so it is correct on first paint, before any script runs. The same button is in this site's header from 1024px up, and in the footer below that.</p>
